WEBVTT

00:00:00.102 --> 00:00:02.583
A Store is an entity type a definition

00:00:02.446 --> 00:00:04.393
of something the business cares about

00:00:05.812 --> 00:00:07.980
Region and priority are properties

00:00:09.386 --> 00:00:12.791
Store operates Refrigeration Unit is a relationship between

00:00:12.654 --> 00:00:13.976
two entity types

00:00:15.384 --> 00:00:18.646
Data bindings map these definitions to source fields

00:00:19.397 --> 00:00:22.659
The ontology supplies meaning and mappings the data

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:23.909
stays in its source

